\alttext(Left-to-right faster rcnn architecture with rotated names and exact output shapes.)

> Simple example: anchors on a shared stride grid

At each of 16x16 stride-four feature cells, the RPN scores nine anchors: sizes
12, 20 and 30, each at height/width ratios .5, 1 and 2. That makes 2304 anchors.
The anchor centred at feature row 5, column 7 with size 20 and ratio one is
`[12,20,32,40]` in pixel `(ymin,xmin,ymax,xmax)` coordinates.

A maximum IoU at least .7 makes an anchor positive; below .3 means negative;
the interval between is ignored. Each overlapping target also forces its best
anchor positive, with later targets winning conflicts. Matching is discrete.
The maps below show maximum overlap and the fraction of positive anchor types
at every cell for a target exactly equal to that known anchor.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/faster_rcnn_anchors.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  const auto anchors = n::anchor_grid(16, 16, 4, {12, 20, 30}, {.5, 1, 2});
  const int index = (5 * 16 + 7) * 9 + 4;
  const auto target = n::slice_axis(anchors, 0, index, index + 1),
             iou = n::box_iou(anchors, target);
  const auto match = n::match_boxes(iou, .7, .3, true);
  if (match.at({index}) != 0 || n::max(n::abs(n::encode_boxes(target, target))).item() > 1e-6)
    return 1;
  const auto overlap = n::max(iou.reshape({16, 16, 9}), {2}),
             positive = n::mean(
                 n::greater_equal(match, 0.).to(n::DType::Float32).reshape({16, 16, 9}), {2});
  auto a = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(overlap, {0}), 0, 1);
  a.title("Best anchor IoU per cell")
      .x_label("feature column")
      .y_label("feature row")
      .x_limits(-.5, 15.5)
      .y_limits(-.5, 15.5);
  auto b = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(positive, {0}), 0, 1);
  b.title("Positive fraction of nine anchors")
      .x_label("feature column")
      .y_label("feature row")
      .x_limits(-.5, 15.5)
      .y_limits(-.5, 15.5);
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2).add(a).add(b).size(1200, 550).fit_panels().save_svg(
      "build/faster_rcnn_anchors.svg");
  std::print("2304 anchors; selected target [{:.0f},{:.0f},{:.0f},{:.0f}] at index {}. "
             "Positive {}, ignored {}, negative {}; self-encoding is zero.\n",
             target.at({0, 0}), target.at({0, 1}), target.at({0, 2}), target.at({0, 3}), index,
             n::count_nonzero(n::greater_equal(match, 0.)).item(),
             n::count_nonzero(n::equal(match, -2.)).item(),
             n::count_nonzero(n::equal(match, -1.)).item());
}
```
